WEBVTT

00:14.139 --> 00:15.432
Who is he?

00:16.433 --> 00:19.227
She's Jolyne Cujoh!

00:19.310 --> 00:21.354
Not Lang Rangler!

00:21.938 --> 00:26.151
Should I assume that he failed,
and she's the one with the disc?

00:26.234 --> 00:30.989
In a matter of minutes, her ally will come
and get the disc at the courtyard.

00:31.072 --> 00:35.076
He's the chaplain of this prison.

00:35.869 --> 00:37.203
Why is he here now?

00:37.704 --> 00:39.164
She knows who I am.

00:40.081 --> 00:45.170
No, she would've already attacked me
if she knew I was her enemy.

00:45.253 --> 00:47.172
Wait! Please, Father!

00:47.756 --> 00:48.882
Please…

00:48.965 --> 00:51.009
Don't sound the alarm!

00:51.092 --> 00:54.387
I'm not here to cause any trouble!

00:55.096 --> 00:56.056
What should I do?

00:56.139 --> 00:58.224
It would be easy to beat him unconscious.

00:58.308 --> 01:01.519
That's nothing
compared to my father's life.

01:02.103 --> 01:03.354
Hitting him is nothing…

01:05.732 --> 01:08.026
There is already a problem.

01:08.735 --> 01:12.530
You unlocked the door
using another inmate's work permit.

01:13.531 --> 01:18.828
Where is the owner of this permit,
the inmate, Lang Rangler?

01:19.496 --> 01:23.666
I know I just met you,
and I don't expect you to believe me.

01:23.750 --> 01:25.627
But I'm no liar, Father.

01:25.710 --> 01:28.254
That inmate attacked me.

01:28.880 --> 01:30.131
It was self-defense.

01:30.757 --> 01:34.094
He's passed out in that basket over there.

01:34.177 --> 01:38.306
I must report this to the authorities.

01:38.890 --> 01:40.725
I understand, Father.

01:40.809 --> 01:43.686
But it has to be
after I go to the courtyard.

01:43.770 --> 01:45.271
I only need two minutes…

01:45.355 --> 01:47.899
No, give me just a single minute, Father.

01:47.982 --> 01:51.277
I must go to the courtyard.
That's all I ask.

01:52.987 --> 01:55.657
You want me to turn a blind eye?

01:56.282 --> 01:57.992
It's a matter of life and death.

01:59.035 --> 02:00.995
My father's life and soul depend on it.

02:01.496 --> 02:04.415
A man of God should understand.

02:04.499 --> 02:06.209
Are you here by yourself?

02:06.835 --> 02:09.129
Is there anyone else with you?

02:10.088 --> 02:12.090
No, I'm alone.

02:12.799 --> 02:15.218
I lied to a chaplain.

02:15.301 --> 02:18.304
But surely, a small lie can be forgiven.

02:18.388 --> 02:21.057
And I can't tell him about the disc.

02:21.641 --> 02:22.851
Please.

02:22.934 --> 02:24.686
I only need a minute.

02:24.769 --> 02:31.568
Doing something for others
is all an act of expecting a reward.

02:31.651 --> 02:36.322
To be kind to others
is to expect kindness from others.

02:36.406 --> 02:38.533
There is no such thing as
unconditional love.

02:38.616 --> 02:40.743
Because unconditional love

02:41.661 --> 02:44.247
is a reward to go to heaven.

02:45.081 --> 02:46.499
You may go.

02:46.583 --> 02:48.793
I will pretend I didn't see you here.

02:50.712 --> 02:53.506
But only a minute as requested.

02:53.590 --> 02:56.676
You have to come back
to this gate by then.

03:01.514 --> 03:02.724
I have no choice.

03:03.266 --> 03:05.852
Someone is hiding behind that container.

03:06.477 --> 03:07.937
If she has an ally with her,

03:08.021 --> 03:09.689
I can't reveal myself.

03:09.772 --> 03:13.818
I can't expose Pale Snake and kill Jolyne.

03:24.495 --> 03:26.789
The Speedwagon Foundation said

03:26.873 --> 03:30.335
I'll know how to hand over
the DISC once I arrive

03:31.211 --> 03:33.296
once I go to the courtyard.

03:36.257 --> 03:37.133
You…

03:37.842 --> 03:40.470
Do you have a pass permit?

03:48.102 --> 03:50.355
Seems like you don't have one.

03:50.438 --> 03:52.732
You are charged with attempted escape.

03:52.815 --> 03:55.443
What? What just happened?

03:55.526 --> 03:59.197
I never intended to sound the alarm.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.865
I made the right move

04:00.949 --> 04:04.118
to have a prison guard
watch the courtyard.

05:42.842 --> 05:44.510
EPISODE 12: TORRENTIAL DOWNPOUR WARNING

05:44.594 --> 05:47.388
It was 1988.

05:48.014 --> 05:50.183
I befriended a man from Egypt

05:50.808 --> 05:54.771
who claimed that
he had the power to stop time.

05:55.563 --> 05:58.483
This man suddenly said to me…

05:58.566 --> 06:02.612
There may be a way to go to heaven.

06:03.196 --> 06:05.698
He was young and beautiful,

06:05.782 --> 06:09.160
and yet he had the countenance
of a man who has lived for centuries.

06:09.869 --> 06:13.706
I was 16 at that time.
A student advancing my studies.

06:15.083 --> 06:17.794
Hey, don't make a face.

06:17.877 --> 06:19.754
I'm not talking about death.

06:19.837 --> 06:24.342
The heaven I'm talking about
pertains to our spirits.

06:24.425 --> 06:26.260
The place our spirits are headed.

06:26.344 --> 06:29.138
The power of our mind
must surely evolve there.

06:29.222 --> 06:31.682
And ultimately where our spirits end up.

06:32.725 --> 06:36.270
Surely, you understand
what I'm talking about more than anyone.

06:37.397 --> 06:40.024
True happiness lies there.

06:40.108 --> 06:43.027
Only if you can reach heaven.

06:43.111 --> 06:44.362
I know that happiness

06:44.445 --> 06:48.408
can't be obtained by having
the mightiest body, the most money,

06:48.491 --> 06:51.119
or the highest status.

06:52.120 --> 06:54.038
True victory

06:54.122 --> 06:56.457
belongs to those who have seen heaven.

06:57.458 --> 07:00.920
I will do everything to reach that end.

07:02.213 --> 07:04.590
Can you be more specific?

07:04.674 --> 07:08.219
I've recorded it in a notebook.

07:08.302 --> 07:10.555
Come visit Egypt sometime.

07:11.722 --> 07:13.474
I will show you then.

07:13.975 --> 07:16.519
I will need your help

07:16.602 --> 07:18.604
to test my theory.

07:19.397 --> 07:20.398
However,

07:20.481 --> 07:22.942
before I learned of his methods…

07:27.780 --> 07:30.116
his notebook was burned to ashes.

07:31.117 --> 07:33.870
The one who burned it
was Jolyne Cujoh's father,

07:33.953 --> 07:35.621
Jotaro Kujo.

07:36.330 --> 07:39.876
Jotaro read the contents of that notebook.

07:40.543 --> 07:43.337
And he sealed its contents forever

07:44.338 --> 07:48.342
along with Dio Brando
who aimed for heaven.

07:50.219 --> 07:53.931
I laid in wait for over two decades

07:54.015 --> 07:56.934
to gain access to Jotaro Kujo's memory.

07:57.018 --> 08:00.229
The contents of the notebook
are within his memory.

08:01.606 --> 08:05.902
And I finally obtained his memory

08:05.985 --> 08:10.239
along with Star Platinum,
which surpassed Dio.

08:10.740 --> 08:13.951
And now, Jotaro's body will only decay.

08:14.577 --> 08:18.748
Though his daughter has acted
quite unpredictably at this prison,

08:19.332 --> 08:22.460
my plan is back on schedule.

08:26.297 --> 08:28.216
She got shot!

08:28.299 --> 08:29.842
Jolyne got shot!

08:29.926 --> 08:32.261
Who? Was it a guard?

08:32.345 --> 08:34.597
Or did our enemy learn of our plan

08:34.680 --> 08:37.683
and Pale Snake is lurking nearby?

08:41.771 --> 08:43.481
Jolyne!

08:47.109 --> 08:50.112
The guard will retrieve Star Platinum.

08:50.196 --> 08:52.657
My business here is finished.

08:53.241 --> 08:56.327
I shall return to the chapel.

08:57.161 --> 08:58.412
What…

08:58.496 --> 09:00.915
What was this thing?

09:00.998 --> 09:02.250
It's a disc.

09:02.875 --> 09:03.751
That's right,

09:03.834 --> 09:07.213
I was ordered to retrieve this disc.

09:08.214 --> 09:13.594
He also ordered me
to finish her off completely.

09:13.678 --> 09:15.846
But whose order was it?

09:16.847 --> 09:18.474
I don't remember…

09:25.273 --> 09:27.984
Anyway, I received an order

09:28.067 --> 09:32.655
to blow her brains out.

09:32.738 --> 09:34.115
It's over.

09:34.198 --> 09:37.243
There's nothing more I can do.

09:37.827 --> 09:41.497
I cannot help you…

09:41.581 --> 09:42.957
You're finished,

09:43.040 --> 09:45.751
Jolyne Cujoh!

10:00.349 --> 10:03.185
What the hell?!

10:04.228 --> 10:06.147
My ability, Weather Forecast,

10:07.023 --> 10:09.191
manipulates the weather.

10:10.192 --> 10:12.945
This is all I can do.

10:13.696 --> 10:14.530
Jolyne,

10:15.197 --> 10:17.241
I may not be able to save you,

10:17.325 --> 10:19.619
but I can still protect the disc.

10:20.244 --> 10:24.582
And if you still have the conviction,

10:25.791 --> 10:27.960
you too may be able to make it out.

10:33.466 --> 10:40.306
Between 1887 and 1974,
in Florida alone,

10:40.389 --> 10:41.641
it was reported 

10:41.724 --> 10:47.229
that more than 50 cases of fish, frogs,
snakes and sheep fell from the sky.

10:47.855 --> 10:51.609
The cause is attributed
to tornadoes and whirlwinds.

10:51.692 --> 10:53.319
And these are poison dart frogs,

10:53.402 --> 10:56.989
which live atop the trees
of Central and South America.

10:58.324 --> 11:03.412
It carries subcutaneous poison so deadly,
even aboriginals used them for blowguns.

11:08.834 --> 11:12.421
What the hell are these frogs?!

11:18.427 --> 11:19.720
These are…

11:20.429 --> 11:21.847
These frogs.

11:21.931 --> 11:24.767
Aren't they poison dart frogs,
known for their toxicity?

11:24.850 --> 11:28.020
Once their poison enters the body,
it takes mere seconds

11:28.104 --> 11:30.606
for the heart and respiratory system
to shut down.

11:30.690 --> 11:34.110
That's what's splattering
along with their body fluid right now.

11:35.486 --> 11:36.696
Pale Snake!

11:37.279 --> 11:38.572
This ability…

11:38.656 --> 11:41.826
Could it be his,
who manipulates the weather?

11:42.535 --> 11:44.286
Weather Forecast.

11:44.370 --> 11:46.288
He should have lost his memory.

11:46.872 --> 11:49.500
Was he the one hiding behind the barrel?

11:50.793 --> 11:52.753
This is bad! Card key!

12:13.941 --> 12:16.986
These frogs are poisonous.

12:17.653 --> 12:20.114
What happened to me?

12:20.197 --> 12:21.949
Did I get shot?

12:22.032 --> 12:23.242
Are the wounds deep?

12:23.784 --> 12:28.205
The poison,
it's seeping through the threads!

12:28.789 --> 12:31.667
Someone, open the gate!

12:31.751 --> 12:32.710
Please!

12:34.378 --> 12:35.463
Calm down.

12:35.963 --> 12:38.007
I must keep my composure.

12:38.591 --> 12:40.634
What do I do in such a situation?

12:40.718 --> 12:43.846
Two, three, five.

12:43.929 --> 12:44.805
Calm down.

12:44.889 --> 12:45.723
Seven.

12:45.806 --> 12:48.184
Count prime numbers and calm down.

12:48.267 --> 12:52.980
Prime numbers are solitary numbers
that can only be divided by 1 and itself.

12:53.063 --> 12:55.441
They give me strength.

12:56.025 --> 12:57.401
Twenty-three.

12:57.485 --> 12:58.819
Twenty-eight.

12:58.903 --> 13:00.905
No, 29.

13:00.988 --> 13:02.114
Dammit.

13:02.198 --> 13:05.451
The frogs are covering
my 800 dollar pants!

13:06.035 --> 13:08.204
Weather Forecast is in the laundry room.

13:08.287 --> 13:09.121
He's too far.

13:09.872 --> 13:12.124
I cannot stop this downpour of frogs.

13:12.625 --> 13:15.169
I must escape.

13:15.252 --> 13:16.837
Forty-one.

13:17.671 --> 13:18.589
That's right.

13:18.672 --> 13:20.299
The guard in the courtyard.

13:20.382 --> 13:22.968
He's still under my command
by the disc. What happened to him?

13:23.052 --> 13:25.971
Guard, do you hear me?

13:26.597 --> 13:29.225
I order you to come here!

13:32.770 --> 13:35.439
Father!

13:35.523 --> 13:38.150
Help me!

13:38.234 --> 13:41.487
Ask God to save me, please!

13:42.071 --> 13:43.155
Forty-three.

13:43.239 --> 13:44.532
Forty-seven.

13:44.615 --> 13:45.699
Fifty-three.

13:45.783 --> 13:47.076
Fifty-nine.

13:47.159 --> 13:48.327
What a potent poison.

13:50.287 --> 13:54.875
-Tell God to save me!
-So you do hear me.

13:54.959 --> 13:57.670
Give me your card key!

13:57.753 --> 14:02.132
Will I make it out?

14:02.216 --> 14:05.219
Hey! Don't take it out right now, idiot!

14:05.302 --> 14:08.055
Father!

14:13.310 --> 14:14.270
Sixty-seven.

14:14.937 --> 14:16.063
Seventy-one.

14:16.856 --> 14:19.400
What is going on here?

14:20.025 --> 14:21.527
These frogs…

14:22.111 --> 14:23.195
I'm saved!

14:23.696 --> 14:25.865
Open the gate immediately!

14:26.448 --> 14:27.867
Father?

14:27.950 --> 14:28.826
What's going on?

14:28.909 --> 14:30.995
I don't know! A tornado, most likely.

14:31.078 --> 14:32.788
Anyway, hurry it up!

14:32.872 --> 14:33.706
Understood.

14:33.789 --> 14:34.957
I'll open it now.

14:37.251 --> 14:39.211
These frogs, they're…

14:39.295 --> 14:40.796
What are you doing?

14:40.880 --> 14:43.007
There's an unconscious guard on this side.

14:43.090 --> 14:44.466
Hurry, open the door!

14:44.550 --> 14:45.843
An unconscious guard?

14:46.927 --> 14:48.679
Hold on, Father.

14:48.762 --> 14:51.140
I'll get help right away!

14:51.223 --> 14:53.434
Wait! Where are you going?

14:53.517 --> 14:55.019
Just open this door!

14:55.102 --> 14:56.478
That's it!

14:57.104 --> 14:58.981
I understand,

14:59.064 --> 15:00.816
but what if I need permission?

15:00.900 --> 15:02.902
Let me ask my superior.

15:02.985 --> 15:05.988
Stay calm. Calm down, Father!

15:06.071 --> 15:08.198
I am very calm.

15:08.282 --> 15:09.867
The one who's not calm…

15:09.950 --> 15:10.993
Seventy-three.

15:11.076 --> 15:12.202
Seventy-nine.

15:12.286 --> 15:13.913
…is you!

15:13.996 --> 15:16.206
You dare abandon me?

15:16.290 --> 15:18.459
I'll be back soon, Father!

15:18.542 --> 15:19.835
Pale Snake!

15:20.461 --> 15:22.546
Give me a disc!

15:25.716 --> 15:27.801
I may not be able to control all of them,

15:27.885 --> 15:30.095
but I can control one frog.

15:30.846 --> 15:32.932
Explode after jumping ten meters.

15:33.807 --> 15:35.517
I order you!

15:43.233 --> 15:44.360
My eyes!

15:45.444 --> 15:47.613
Save me. Father, call for help, please!

15:47.696 --> 15:48.822
Father,

15:48.906 --> 15:51.075
please!

15:51.158 --> 15:52.534
Eighty-three.

15:52.618 --> 15:53.953
Eighty-nine.

15:54.036 --> 15:55.162
Ninety-seven.

15:55.245 --> 15:57.373
I'm right here.

15:58.248 --> 15:59.792
You believe that

15:59.875 --> 16:02.294
if I leave here and call for help,

16:02.378 --> 16:04.129
you could get treated right away.

16:04.713 --> 16:07.341
That is what you're thinking, right?

16:07.424 --> 16:11.637
Then come towards my voice.

16:16.558 --> 16:19.770
Father!

16:20.688 --> 16:23.774
Jotaro Kujo's disc, Star Platinum.

16:24.733 --> 16:26.694
What should I do with it?

16:26.777 --> 16:29.863
I have eliminated Jolyne Cujoh,
but I cannot leave her there.

16:30.447 --> 16:32.616
Did the gate open?

16:32.700 --> 16:34.201
Take me with you…

16:34.284 --> 16:35.119
Father?

16:35.703 --> 16:38.831
Where are you, Father?!

16:40.040 --> 16:41.834
I'm at the end of my rope.

16:42.418 --> 16:44.128
I can't guard against the the poison!

16:44.211 --> 16:46.088
The disc that I let go…

16:46.672 --> 16:48.424
I don't know where it is anymore!

17:04.690 --> 17:06.150
The rain stopped.

17:07.818 --> 17:11.739
Where is Jolyne Cujoh's corpse?

17:12.489 --> 17:15.576
The disc must be close by.

17:16.160 --> 17:17.995
That was vexing,

17:18.078 --> 17:20.956
but my Snake would never lose to frogs.

17:21.623 --> 17:23.042
Search for it.

17:23.709 --> 17:27.296
Pale Snake's range is 20 meters at most.

17:27.379 --> 17:31.884
It would pose a serious problem
if anyone spots me here,

17:32.593 --> 17:34.344
but I'm out of options.

17:38.265 --> 17:40.893
The soul of a dead criminal

17:40.976 --> 17:46.231
returns to the earth in the form of a frog
in want of companions to the afterlife.

17:46.315 --> 17:49.651
I've heard of such a legend
existing in the East.

17:49.735 --> 17:53.489
Doesn't it describe
this hellish scene perfectly?

17:53.572 --> 17:56.950
And the disc must be
somewhere around here.

17:58.077 --> 17:58.994
Pale Snake.

17:59.953 --> 18:03.332
Search towards the gate from there.

18:04.041 --> 18:06.293
The guard might have taken it.

18:06.376 --> 18:08.462
It must be within that direction.

18:10.506 --> 18:11.548
I found it!

18:14.718 --> 18:16.637
I've recovered the disc.

18:17.471 --> 18:18.514
Thanks.

18:18.597 --> 18:21.100
I was waiting for you to find it.

18:31.693 --> 18:33.445
Goddammit.

18:33.529 --> 18:35.280
It's grossing me out.

18:35.364 --> 18:38.367
They're stuck on my face. Yuck.

18:39.118 --> 18:42.204
The frogs splatter poison
when they hit the ground and burst.

18:42.913 --> 18:45.290
If they aren't crushed, they are harmless.

18:45.374 --> 18:48.710
I made a net with the living frogs

18:48.794 --> 18:51.255
to lessen the impact of falling frogs.

18:51.839 --> 18:55.300
And I waited for you to find the disc.

18:56.135 --> 18:58.303
What a futile attempt!

18:59.513 --> 19:02.558
I'll kill you, you piece of shit!

19:11.483 --> 19:13.986
He was already here.

19:14.486 --> 19:17.197
The envoy from
The Speedwagon Foundation, that is.

19:17.281 --> 19:19.616
He wasn't even human,

19:19.700 --> 19:21.660
and he came exactly on time.

19:21.743 --> 19:25.706
He weaved past the rain of frogs
and reached this courtyard.

19:26.707 --> 19:29.042
Savage Guardian is the name of a pigeon.

19:29.126 --> 19:33.213
The trained homing pigeon
will carry the disc to the right place.

19:36.800 --> 19:37.801
Pale Snake!

19:37.885 --> 19:40.387
The gun the guard dropped is by the gate!

19:40.470 --> 19:42.389
Shoot the pigeon down!

19:46.476 --> 19:47.394
That damn guard!

19:47.477 --> 19:49.229
He used up all the bullets!

19:49.313 --> 19:50.147
Dammit!

19:52.691 --> 19:54.026
I won.

19:54.568 --> 19:57.112
Don't underestimate me!

19:57.196 --> 19:59.072
Nothing has changed.

19:59.156 --> 20:02.910
Even with Star Platinum,
your father is still a living mummy!

20:02.993 --> 20:08.290
He won't even recall his own daughter!

20:08.373 --> 20:10.959
Look! A guard is down!

20:11.043 --> 20:12.461
Don't step on the frogs!

20:12.544 --> 20:14.254
Search the courtyard!

20:14.338 --> 20:15.756
Someone might be there!

20:18.759 --> 20:21.553
Don't blank out yet.

20:21.637 --> 20:23.764
Its Stand User must be close by.

20:25.015 --> 20:28.185
I must find Pale Snake's Stand User first.

20:28.268 --> 20:32.022
The User has my father's memory disc.

20:32.105 --> 20:35.484
Now's my chance to find its User!

20:37.027 --> 20:39.446
Hey! Look out the window!

20:39.529 --> 20:40.405
Oh my god!

20:40.489 --> 20:42.824
It's a miracle! It has to be!

20:43.575 --> 20:45.327
But who's going to clean this up?

20:45.827 --> 20:47.496
The tide hasn't changed.

20:48.080 --> 20:50.832
I took Jotaro's Star Platinum

20:50.916 --> 20:54.962
only out of my pledge
to avenge Dio, my friend.

20:55.671 --> 20:58.423
The memory disc is the one that matters,

20:58.507 --> 21:00.425
and it's in my hands.

21:00.509 --> 21:02.552
Everything is according to plan.

21:02.636 --> 21:04.596
Only Jotaro's memory

21:04.680 --> 21:07.099
contains clues to attain heaven.

21:17.276 --> 21:21.613
An abnormal situation where the frogs
rain only in the prison courtyard.

21:25.200 --> 21:30.455
Jolyne's escape attempt
was unquestioned in this chaos.

21:34.001 --> 21:40.674
And The Speedwagon Foundation
obtained Jotaro Kujo's Star Platinum disc.

21:41.258 --> 21:47.055
But Jotaro's soul won't return
without the Memory disc.

23:21.650 --> 23:23.068
Sports Maximum.

23:23.652 --> 23:26.446
I wanted to ask you about this bone.

23:27.114 --> 23:31.243
I want you to try something
using your ability.

23:31.827 --> 23:34.538
Is that a human bone?

23:34.621 --> 23:35.831
Whose is it?

23:35.914 --> 23:37.749
That doesn't concern you.

23:37.833 --> 23:40.460
Let's just say it belongs to
an old friend of mine.

23:41.503 --> 23:43.088
My dear friend,

23:43.171 --> 23:45.090
Dio's bone.

23:46.925 --> 23:48.927
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
